 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,72px);align-items:start\"><div><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/business-accounts\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Business accounts</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">AED account</span></nav><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:32px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ae.svg\" alt=\"UAE dirham\" style=\"width:96px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">AED</span></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0\">A UAE dirham account for your business<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:50ch\">Your own AED account details, so customers and partners pay you like a local. Hold AED alongside 29 other currencies and USDC and USDT, and convert between them.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\">Open a AED account</a><a href=\"/coverage\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">All 30 currencies →</a></div><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A;margin:20px 0 0\">Updated October 2026</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B4B1D0\">QUICK ANSWER</div><p style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:28px;margin:12px 0 0\">Yes. ElementPay issues dedicated AED accounts to verified businesses, one account per currency. You can receive, hold and convert UAE dirhams, and use the balance to fund payouts in 20 African countries.</p></div><div style=\"border-radius:24px;background:#F6F4EF;padding:8px;display:grid;gap:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Currency</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">AED · UAE dirham</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Account number</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Dedicated</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Bank details</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Local bank code</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Rails</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Local AED transfers</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Converts to</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">29 currencies, USDC, USDT</span></div></div></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">What you can do with AED.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#3B2ED3\">01</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Receive</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Share your AED account details on invoices. Payments arrive in your ElementPay balance.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#3B2ED3\">02</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Hold</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Keep AED on the same balance sheet as your other currencies and stablecoins.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#3B2ED3\">03</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Convert</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Exchange AED to any of 29 currencies or USDC and USDT at a quote locked before you confirm.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#3B2ED3\">04</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0\">Pay out</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Fund payouts to mobile money and banks in 20 African countries.</p></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:start\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">About AED accounts.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;grid-column:span 2;min-width:0\"><details open=\"\" style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Can a business outside United Arab Emirates open a AED account with ElementPay?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes, subject to business verification. ElementPay issues AED accounts, one per currency, to verified businesses so they can receive and pay in UAE dirhams.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">What can I do with a AED account?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Receive AED from customers and partners with your own account details, hold the balance, convert to any of 29 other currencies or to USDC and USDT, and pay out to mobile money and banks in 20 African countries.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">How fast are conversions from AED?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Conversions settle at a quote shown before you confirm. Large tickets can be quoted by the OTC desk.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Can I convert AED to USDC or USDT?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes. AED balances convert to and from USDC and USDT on the same balance sheet.</p></details></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Other account currencies.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:24px\"><a href=\"/open-a-usd-account\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:500\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/us.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:24px;height:16px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\">USD</a><a href=\"/open-a-eur-account\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px;border-radius:14px;backgrou